# Newton Assignment AI environment

NEWTON_BASE_URL="https://my.newtonschool.co"
# Set this to your enrolled course details page; it is not the sign-in URL.
NEWTON_COURSE_URL="https://my.newtonschool.co/course/<course-id>/details"
# The sign-in entry point is kept separate from the course dashboard.
NEWTON_LOGIN_URL="https://my.newtonschool.co/login"
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"

# AI provider (Groq is selected automatically when GROQ_API_KEY is set).
AI_PROVIDER="groq"
GROQ_API_KEY="gsk_..."
AI_MODEL="llama-3.3-70b-versatile"
# Optional OpenAI-compatible endpoint override:
# AI_BASE_URL="https://api.groq.com/openai/v1"

## Setup

```bash
npm install
npm run db:generate
npm run db:push
npm run dev
```

Then open http://localhost:3000. Newton sign-in is completed manually in a visible Chromium
window; Newton credentials are never sent to this application. Install the browser once with
`npx playwright install chromium` if it is not already available.
